# Schedule definitions for thorn PlanesX

# CarpetX traverses CCTK_POSTSTEP on every iteration -- including the recovery
# iteration, where CCTK_ANALYSIS is skipped -- immediately before it calls
# CCTK_OutputGH. Files registered here via OutputMeta_RegisterOutputFile are
# therefore still described by CarpetX's OutputMeta (which runs at the end of
# its OutputGH) in the same iteration.
SCHEDULE PlanesX_Output AT poststep
{
  LANG: C
  OPTIONS: global
} "Output 2D axis-aligned planes in Silo and openPMD format"
